# Hiding things (docs/DIALOGUE.md, "Lies you're told"): a speaker keeps something back behind a
# default deflection in their own voice, with a Press beside it (persuade, or a threat where one is
# allowed), and a fail branch that isn't a dead end. And topics other systems put in front of you:
# the packs on the hills near a house, a voter's lean at a sitting.

conv redhand.boss.crossed
for seat:redhand/crew_boss
when tier:redhand>=known
topic "Ask whose line is crossed out."
prio world
voice redhand

node start
  say "Book's the book. Ask me something else."
  > @press "I saw the page. Whose name was that?" -> told | short   check persuade redhand 2 bg:excon
  > @lean "Tell me. Or I mention the second book." -> told | laughed   check threaten redhand 2
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node told
  say "...A lad from the bridge crew. Paid in full. Day 9. He didn't pay. The infected did. Book balances."
  do learn:redhand.crossed
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

node short
  say "Nice try. The page is the page. Come back when you're in the book yourself."
  > @back2 "Something else." -> hub

node laughed
  say "Two books! Lads, two books. Course I keep two books. Everyone knows. Go on, then, tell them."
  > @back3 "Something else." -> hub

conv occupant.hills
for occupant
when tribe & !house:died
topic "Ask about the hills."
prio world
voice haven

node start
  say? alpha :: "{pack} again. And {pack_leader} with them. We keep the shutters down after dark."
  say "{pack}, up the hill. You hear them at dusk. You learn not to answer."
  > @where "Where do they go in the day?" -> day
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node day
  say "Somewhere quiet. Somewhere we don't go. Nobody's been to look, and nobody's volunteering."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

# Topics other systems put in front of you (docs/DIALOGUE.md, "Trees"): a major's sitting, heard of
# at another faction's seat while it runs. Plain gossip, never a joke in its first real day.
conv bastion.leader.haven_sitting
for stronghold:bastion
when q:every_name.summoned & !ending:every_name
topic "Ask about the Haven's sitting."
prio world
voice bastion

node start
  say "The Haven is voting on who eats. Show of hands, round a pot. We'd use a register."
  say "If they want ours, it's on the wall. Nobody's asked."
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

conv redhand.leader.haven_sitting
for stronghold:redhand
when q:every_name.summoned & !ending:every_name
topic "Ask about the Haven's sitting."
prio world
voice redhand

node start
  say "The Haven's voting on dinner. Lovely people. I've got odds on the pot, if you're interested."
  say "Whatever they decide, somebody's hungry by Thursday. Somebody always is. That's where we come in."
  > @back "Something else." -> hub
